{"id":4475,"date":"2025-06-17T17:09:55","date_gmt":"2025-06-17T16:09:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/?p=4475"},"modified":"2025-10-08T16:33:11","modified_gmt":"2025-10-08T15:33:11","slug":"franck-marcaire-joins-ccacs-board-of-trustees","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/franck-marcaire-joins-ccacs-board-of-trustees\/","title":{"rendered":"Franck Marcaire joins CCAC&#8217;s board of trustees"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-22f004f\" data-block-id=\"22f004f\"><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-4481 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Franck-article-main-image.jpg\" width=\"1047\" height=\"774\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Franck-article-main-image.jpg 1047w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Franck-article-main-image-300x222.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Franck-article-main-image-1024x757.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Franck-article-main-image-768x568.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Franck-article-main-image-271x200.jpg 271w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Franck-article-main-image-169x125.jpg 169w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1047px) 100vw, 1047px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1047px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1047\/774;\" \/><\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>We are delighted to welcome technology infrastructure strategist Franck Marcaire to our board of trustees.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Franck&nbsp;Marcaire&nbsp;is a newly appointed&nbsp;CCAC&nbsp;trustee who brings both strategic expertise and a deep personal commitment to global climate action. Based in London with his wife and two children, he combines the perspective of an engaged parent&nbsp;with his professional&nbsp;record of advancing positive change through technology.<br><br>Franck&nbsp;specialises in growth strategies for converging sectors such as mobility, energy, and digital services, with wide experience&nbsp;in&nbsp;platforms and infrastructure. Since 2017, he has held important director-level roles in technology start-ups, building new business lines and scaling organisations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Earlier in his career, Franck held senior positions, including Head of Strategy at Vodafone Australia during its turnaround. He had previously spent his formative years at McKinsey, Morgan Stanley and IBM.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CCAC looks forward to benefitting from Franck\u2019s strategic insight and experience as we continue to grow as a charity. With his passion for global climate action and ability to spark positive change, Franck is a brilliant fit for CCAC and an excellent addition to our board of trustees.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We are delighted to welcome technology infrastructure strategist Franck Marcaire to our board of trustees.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9,"featured_media":4477,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[12],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4475","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-ccac-news"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Franck Marcaire joins CCAC&#039;s board of trustees - Climate Change All Change<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"